OL,3,GNEWSARelief as Edinburgh's Princes
OL,4,AStreet reopens seven weeks after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FEdinburgh council leader Jane Meagher
OL,7,Fsaid she was delighted the thoroughfare
OL,8,Fwas reopening but acknowledged it had
OL,9,Fbeen a difficult chapter for the city.
